        <mxCell id="d4_title" value="D4 ｜ §3.3-a 控制空间主干：控制点硬条件 → MLP_T / PE → TrajBlock ×N_T=8 → H_ctrl；SceneCNN → C_G / C_E" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=16;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="2200" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d4_foot" value="对应代码：planner.py:462 hard_control_endpoints · encoders.py:40 TrajectoryEncoder · blocks.py:34/81 TrajSelfAttention/TrajBlock · common/blocks.py:20 AdaLN · common/scene_cnn.py:64 SceneCNN · position_encoding.py ｜ C=48, D=128, N_T=8, heads=4, FFN=512" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=10;fontColor=#888888;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1390" width="2320" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d4_legend" value="图例：圆形 + = 残差相加　立方体 = 张量 / 状态　紫色虚线箭 = 时间步 \(h_t\) 注入　蓝色虚线箭 = 场景记忆 \(C_G/C_E\)　红色虚线箭 = 历史安全反馈　绿色虚线箭 = 走廊 / 约束包　紫色虚线框 = 重复模块" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Times New Roman;fontSize=10;fontColor=#888888;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1366" width="2320" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
